  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ÷\n\n790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 ⇒ **790 ÷ 5**__ + 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 \n\n158 + __**58 × 5**__ - 96 = 352\n\n__**158 + 290**__ - 96 = 352\n\n__**448 - 96**__ = 352\n\n**352 = 352 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and -​\n\n790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 ⇒ 790 + 5 - 58 × **5 ÷ 96**__ = 352\n\n790 + 5 - __**58 × 0.05**__ = 352\n\n__**790 + 5**__ - 2.9 = 352\n\n__**795 - 2.9**__ = 352\n\n792.1 ≠ 352 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and - \n\n790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 ⇒ 790 - **5 ÷ 58**__ × 5 + 96 = 352\n\n790 - __**0.08 **____**× 5**__ + 96 = 352\n\n__**790 + 96**__ - 0.4 = 352\n\n__**886 - 0.4**__ = 352\n\n885.6 ≠ 352 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and ×\n\n790 + 5 ÷ 58 × 5 - 96 = 352 ⇒ 790 + 5 × **58 ÷ 5**__ - 96 = 352\n\n790 + __**5 **____**× 11.6**__ - 96 = 352\n\n__**790 + 58**__ - 96 = 352\n\n__**848 - 96**__ = 352\n\n752 ≠ 352 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
